{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"shield_wood","model_identifier":"shield_wood","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## shield_wood\n\nShield, wood + iron.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.2..1.0, y -11.0..11.0, z -11.0..11.0 (size 3.2 x 22.0 x 22.0 u = 9 x 62 x 62 cm).\nWooden round shield, about 62 cm (22 u): vertical planks, an iron rim (painted round the stepped disc), an iron band and boss. Origin = **slot_shield_l**, face -X. Iron grade textures for the fittings.\n- Embedded texture: iron_wrought. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `shield_wood_iron_bloom.png`, `shield_wood_iron_wrought.png`, `shield_wood_iron_refined.png`\n"},"description":"## shield_wood\n\nShield, wood + iron.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.2..1.0, y -11.0..11.0, z -11.0..11.0 (size 3.2 x 22.0 x 22.0 u = 9 x 62 x 62 cm).\nWooden round shield, about 62 cm (22 u): vertical planks, an iron rim (painted round the stepped disc), an iron band and boss. Origin = **slot_shield_l**, face -X. Iron grade textures for the fittings.\n- Embedded texture: iron_wrought. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `shield_wood_iron_bloom.png`, `shield_wood_iron_wrought.png`, `shield_wood_iron_refined.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"board_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,-11.0,-4.0],"to":[0.0,-9.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,30,25.0,32.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36,27,44.0,29.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[25,30,26.0,32.0],"texture":0},